4\t\n   575\t- rollout_summaries/2026-09-05T13-37-24-dswi-competitive_intelligence_p3_semantic_view_lossless_pause.md (cwd=/Users/smkzw/Documents/AI Products/competitive-intelligence-workflow, rollout_path=/Users/smkzw/.codex/sessions/2026/09/05/rollout-2026-09-05T21-37-24-01a071c9-c6b5-7ff3-a15a-22fab2fb278a.jsonl, updated_at=2026-09-08T01:33:18+00:00, thread_id=01a071c9-c6b5-7ff3-a15a-22fab2fb278a, current P3 semantic-view pause boundary)\n   576\t\n   577\t### keywords\n   578\t\n   579\t- report-b, `semantic_grouping.py`, `report_b.py`, SemanticGroupingProposal, semantic_row_digest, `scientific_group_id`, `within_trial_longitudinal`, `_dedupe_records`, complete-link, `PAUSE_HANDOFF_20260908_093147.md`, `bb27ec9d`, WebKit, `28/277`, gate, integration, browser\n   580\t\n   581\t## Task 3: Rebaseline the multi-Skill workflow and pause the optional Yaozh browser route, outcome: deterministic quality gates passed but receipt consumption, executable source lineage, freshness policy, and real-host smoke remain incomplete\n   582\t\n   583\t### rollout_summary_files\n   584\t\n   585\t- rollout_summaries/2026-08-09T08-58-28-UfXz-competitive_intelligence_workflow_r25_yaozh_lossless_pause.md (cwd=/Users/smkzw/Documents/AI Products/竞品调研工作流, rollout_path=/Users/smkzw/.codex/sessions/2026/08/09/rollout-2026-08-09T16-58-28-019fe5be-b687-7e11-8c76-2b2c0d2126c9.jsonl, updated_at=2026-09-05T13:35:39+00:00, thread_id=019fe5be-b687-7e11-8c76-2b2c0d2126c9, R2.5 lossless pause; implementation checkout differs)\n   586\t\n   587\t### keywords\n   588\t\n   589\t- R2.5, Yaozh, `YaozhSessionObservation`, `YaozhRouteAccessReceipt`, `commercial_database`, `login_browser`, `designated_industry_source`, receipt consumer, freshness, 947 tests, `in_progress`\n   590\t\n   591\t## User preferences\n   592\t\n   593\t- when designing structured report output, the user rejected CSV/XLSX download-oriented tables: use HTML pages with adapted charts and complete tables hidden by default and expandable on click; preserve three independently designed A/B/C portals while sharing fonts, accessibility, responsiveness, and source conventions. [Task 1] [skysight memory]\n   594\t- when no/insufficient data is found, the user required a third-party-style diagnostic for missed search terms, search-rule errors, or network/data retrieval issues before using a brief explanation or omitting a field; do not fill pages with large empty fields. [Task 1] [skysight memory]\n   595\t- when B-class trials differ in wording, endpoints, or populations, use fuzzy/LLM-assisted substantial-similarity matching and lightly annotate small timepoint differences instead of forcing every variation into a separate display. [Task 1] [skysight memory]\n   596\t- when cross-trial comparison is requested, the user requires clinical semantics rather than exact strings or numerically close values: unknown is not the same, and a hard conflict cannot be overridden by a model. The real HTML must use the same scientific view; an internal helper passing while the portal uses the old glossary is not completion. [Task 2]\n   597\t- for all visible text, labels, and states, the user requires native Chinese clinical-trial language and acceptance from a “懒惰、视觉敏感、非技术背景的资深临床试验医学人员” perspective: inspect real interaction, hierarchy, complete tables, source drawers, and responsive behavior. [Task 2]\n   598\t- when the user says an optional Yaozh route must not block core research or retain credentials/Cookies/profile -> keep it nonblocking, minimally receipted, and distinguish a persisted receipt from a runnable capability. [Task 3]\n   599\t\n   600\t## Reusable knowledge\n   601\t\n   602\t- v1 framing: one public entry with testable sub-skills; existing `competitive-intelligence-workflow` skill is historical/audit input rather than current authority. The three portal positions are `全景台`, `证据室`, and `设计图谱`; the observed first-version exclusions were PDF/PPT export, spreadsheet export, radar charts, evidence-maturity views, and scheduled monitoring. [Task 1] [skysight memory]\n   603\t- Separate “few competitors but sufficient decision value” from an apparently under-collected landscape. For key missing data, use independent clean-context review, two recovery rounds plus final review; for competitor-universe completeness, require source convergence plus independent review. [Task 1] [skysight memory]\n   604\t- Publication handling allows login-dependent source access without credential collection and manual supplement files. Block when a known primary or required extension/long-term publication is unavailable; after explicit one-time confirmation, continuation can be graded rather than silently substituting evidence. Validation targets immune-mediated indications including PNH and IgAN, with large indications for collection completeness and smaller indications for detailed key-trial handling. [Task 1] [skysight memory]\n   605\t- Recovery must collect outputs from the current `format` node’s explicit `site_relative_path` and `manifest_relative_path`, then validate locked site/manifest plus project, contract, report identity, and snapshot chain. A legacy node lacking those bindings fails closed and preserves historical artifacts. The repaired paths passed `722` integration tests, 11 recovery tests, 42 bounded-review tests, Ruff, strict mypy, and the reported gate suites. [Task 2]\n   606\t- `SemanticGroupingProposal` and `semantic_row_digest` bind a proposal to the full observation digest; source changes invalidate it. Use pairwise compatible complete-link buckets to prevent transitive merging; unknown/uncovered observations remain descriptive and are not dropped. A complete clinical unit includes disease/severity, background therapy, population, endpoint/event definition, scale/direction, estimand, denominator, analysis set, statistical form, and actual time window. [Task 2]\n   607\t- P3 uses a complete observation pool to form stable `scientific_group_id`, then projects physical pages after checking row ID, domain, and fact summary. Build `within_trial_longitudinal` before rendering to retain same-trial multi-timepoint identity; reject same-`row_id` cross-domain/fact-summary conflicts and unsupported cross-domain positive proposals. [Task 2]\n   608\t- The current recovery boundary is `context/PAUSE_HANDOFF_20260908_093147.md` at HEAD `bb27ec9d750cf02fb64da5dfe665b2f4b262922d`. Reopen the English implementation directory, hash/current Git state, P3 counterexamples, then independent review, gate, integration, and browser regression in that order. [Task 2]\n   609\t- A Yaozh observation/receipt is only a governed host declaration and secondary cross-check, never direct support for a key clinical conclusion. Require a consumer, freshness decision, executable Yaozh→fact→GateSpec lineage validation, corrupted-record handling, and a real logged-in host smoke before RC. [Task 3]\n   610\t\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
